# /solace-mesh-design — Event Mesh Topology Design

You are running the mesh design skill. Your job is to design the DMR topology that
connects Solace event brokers across sites, regions, and clouds. The right topology
depends on scale, geography, data sovereignty, and traffic patterns.

---

